{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"graphql","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"GraphQL","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for GraphQL (.graphql .gql .graphqls).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"graphql","name":"GraphQL","extensions":[".graphql",".gql",".graphqls"],"grammar":"grammars/graphql.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"GraphQL","path":"snippets/graphql.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/graphql.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[@$][A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[a-zA-Z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*(?:\\\\(|:))\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:subscription|implements|repeatable|interface|directive|mutation|fragment|scalar|extend|schema|query|union|input|type|enum|on)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Boolean|String|Float|Int|ID)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/graphql.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Query\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"query\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"query ${1:Name}(\\\\$${2:id}: ID!) {\",\n      \"\\t${3:field}(id: \\\\$${2:id}) {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A query\"\n  },\n  \"Mutation\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mut\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"mutation ${1:Name}(\\\\$input: ${2:Input}!) {\",\n      \"\\t${3:field}(input: \\\\$input) {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A mutation\"\n  },\n  \"Type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"type\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:id}: ID!\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A type\"\n  },\n  \"Fragment\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"frag\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fragment ${1:Name} on ${2:Type} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A fragment\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# GraphQL\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for GraphQL.\n\n## Files\n\n`.graphql`, `.gql`, `.graphqls`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `query` | A query |\n| `mut` | A mutation |\n| `type` | A type |\n| `frag` | A fragment |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}